  "editorial_self_check": "All 161 selected Hebrew records were read before drafting, and all 161 TSW comparator verses after drafting. NET translators’ notes on chapters 7 and 11 were consulted before drafting for selected lexical and grammatical difficulties. The self-check covered seven people names, explicit ban and harm, spelling variants without duplicate words, fruit and resource lists, all forty-day and forty-year references, divine and human speech, tablets and intercession, the divergent journey notice without harmonization, love and provision for the resident foreigner, irrigation imagery and rain seasons, daily teaching repetition, mountain assignments, sacred versus ordinary meals, clean and unclean diners, blood disposal, explicit child burning, and the 12:32/13:1 mapping. This is authoring and structural QA, not independent scholarly review or reader testing.",
